{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_01",
      "hash": "1e444fd644369518",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「哦哦！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]、[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_08",
      "hash": "1e4448d644368933",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看起來你們兩個\\n都成長了不少啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_09",
      "hash": "1e4447d644368780",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你們來得正好！\\n向你們兩個介紹一下。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_02",
      "hash": "1e4452d644369a31",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這是我的孫子。\\c\\n……呃，\\n名字是叫什麼來著？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_01",
      "hash": "730cd52049366e82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「爺爺，\\n你就別開這種玩笑了！\\c\\n而且我們\\n其實早就認識了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_03",
      "hash": "1e4451d64436987e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「哎呀，真是掃興……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_02",
      "hash": "730cd42049366ccf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「真是的……\\n算了，比起這個……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_03",
      "hash": "730cd32049366b1c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！　[VAR TRNAME(0001)]！\\n你們真是了不起啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_01",
      "hash": "c376b6a23bef83a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「啥？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_04",
      "hash": "730cd22049366969",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「不就是火箭隊那件事嘛！\\c\\n真是想不到，\\n火箭隊的老大當時\\r\\n竟然就在西爾佛公司！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_11",
      "hash": "730951204933585f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是你們兩個\\n把火箭隊打倒的吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_02",
      "hash": "c376b7a23bef8556",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「打倒老大阪木\\n是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]一個人的功勞……！\\c\\n我只是稍微\\n幫了點忙而已……"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main1210_select_01",
      "hash": "565fe7f2f2508995",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main1210_select_02",
      "hash": "565fe4f2f250847c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 13]"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_03",
      "hash": "c376b8a23bef8709",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 14]"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_05",
      "hash": "730cd120493667b6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「沒關係啦！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0001)]也很努力了啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_06",
      "hash": "730cd02049366603",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了好了！\\n就讓我好好獎勵你們一下。"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main1210_red_01",
      "hash": "3728b40d3f0093c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_07",
      "hash": "730ccf2049366450",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 18]"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main1210_red_02",
      "hash": "3728b30d3f00920f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 19]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main1210_sys_01",
      "hash": "a381c93f1818b354",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從青綠那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]鑰石[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_04",
      "hash": "1e4454d644369d97",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「哦哦！\\n這不是鑰石嗎！\\c\\n這是用來發動超越了進化的進化……\\n也就是[VAR COLOR(0006)]超級進化[VAR COLOR(0000)]的石頭！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_04",
      "hash": "c376b9a23bef88bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「超級進化！？\\n那是什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_05",
      "hash": "1e4453d644369be4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了鑰石和[VAR COLOR(0006)]超級石[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n這兩種石頭……\\c\\n就能讓寶可夢在對戰中發動[VAR COLOR(0006)]超級進化[VAR COLOR(0000)]！\\n每場對戰僅限一次喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_10",
      "hash": "1e414ad6443456c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在這時寶可夢會為了訓練家\\n大幅提升自己的能力！\\c\\n可以說這就是寶可夢與訓練家之間\\n有著深厚[VAR COLOR(0006)]牽絆[VAR COLOR(0000)]的證明！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_06",
      "hash": "1e4456d64436a0fd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "請容我作詩一首。\\c\\n兩顆小石頭，\\n加上夥伴一條心，\\r\\n超級大進化……"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_08",
      "hash": "730cde2049367dcd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「以你們兩個的實力，\\n一定可以運用自如的。\\c\\n這就是超級石了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_main1210_sys_02",
      "hash": "a381cc3f1818b86d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]得到了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]妙蛙花進化石[VAR COLOR(0000)]、[VAR COLOR(0006)]噴火龍進化石Ｘ[VAR COLOR(0000)]、\\r\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]噴火龍進化石Ｙ[VAR COLOR(0000)]和[VAR COLOR(0006)]水箭龜進化石[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_09",
      "hash": "730cdd2049367c1a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你們不是要去寶可夢聯盟嗎！\\n那就用用看吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_main1210_green_10",
      "hash": "73095020493356ac",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青綠「話說回來，\\n你們怎麼會來這裡？\\c\\n……什麼？常青道館的\\n館主一直不在？\\c\\n這就怪了……\\n看來之後我也得去看看。"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_main1210_doctor_07",
      "hash": "1e4455d644369f4a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士「你們兩個離寶可夢聯盟\\n就只差最後一步囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_main1210_sys_03",
      "hash": "a381cb3f1818b6ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 31]"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_main1210_rival_05",
      "hash": "c376baa23bef8a6f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「超級進化……\\n要是火箭隊那些傢伙用了這個，\\r\\n那後果就不堪設想了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_main1210_assistant_01",
      "hash": "11a18db531ef6a17",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "除了你們拿到的那些之外，\\n還有其他種類的超級石存在。"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_main1210_assistant_02",
      "hash": "11a18eb531ef6bca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "在關都地區，\\n超級進化可是非常罕見的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_main1210_adultf_01",
      "hash": "7131c42ffb65a163",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真新鎮雖然不大，\\n卻能孕育出這麼多優秀的訓練家，\\r\\n博士一定也很高興吧。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_1210_max",
      "hash": "f1b40d4267e13d51"
    }
  ]
}
